# The Hammond B3 as a stop for dacvoice: as hammond-slow.def, but the
# Leslie at its fast speed (tremolo), about 6.7 Hz, the swings deeper. A
# family's stops must be alike in their Leslie, so it is a family of its own.
name B3 fast
family Leslie fast
n 10
frame 16
start 40 dB
attack 0.005 s
peak 0 dB
decay 0 dB/s
sustain 0 dB
release 0.02 s
chiff 0.003 s 14 dB 8 64
harmonics 1 1.0
rank 1 1.0
rank 3 1.0
rank 2 1.0
level 0 dB
vibrato 6.7 Hz 15 cents free
leslie 3 dB 6 dB
# No interpolate, as hammond-slow.def says.
